# KMA-derived artifact redistribution decisions

Copy this file to `DATA_REDISTRIBUTION_DECISION.md` at the repository root
only after the responsible author has reviewed the KMA source-product terms
and approved both scopes. The repository remains aggregate-only, while the
complete Supplementary Data 1 is intended for journal/archive distribution.

