## Scope of this decision

Under repository decision `public_redistribution_excluded`, the public repository contains schemas,
synthetic examples, non-station aggregate audit results and rendering code,
but does not redistribute KMA station identifiers, names, coordinates, the
514/128 membership table, station-to-grid mappings, stationwise metrics, case
time series, raw observations or per-station predictions.

The separate `derived_station_resolved_archive_approved` decision authorizes
distribution of only the named Supplementary Data 1 sheets through the journal
and/or permanent data archive. Those sheets include held-out-station
identifiers, names and coordinates; distance groups; exact selected-case valid
times; displayed gauge RN60 truth, route predictions and member ranges; stationwise
contingency counts and CSI; and pairwise station tallies. It does not authorize
those sheets in the GitHub repository, the full raw KMA gauge/radar archives,
the complete 514/128 station contract, or dense per-issue prediction stores.

These decisions do not restrict users from obtaining the source products from
KMA under the applicable terms, nor does it grant rights in KMA data. If the
authors later approve a minimal station-resolved release, change
`repository_decision` to
`minimal_redistribution_approved`, define the exact included files and their
license, and rerun the release-ready audit.

The source fields above were prefilled from the official public-data records
available on 2026-08-28. The responsible author must verify that they match the
actual acquisition route used in the study before signing this record.
